   "body_md": "## What listeners single out\n\n- **Isobella With The White Umbrella** (1 other source): As of early 2008, the uploader knew of no other live performance of this song [1]\n\n## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Isobella With The White Umbrella**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [2]\n- **Old Sept Blues**: rare: 14 archived performances [2]\n- **Chills**: earliest performance in the archive; mythic rare: 2 archived performances [2]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **mmj2002-05-01.aud.flac16** (recommended): audience recording; 8 songs; 37 min [1]. Said about its sound: A small cut near 28:39 was edited and is now inaudible; fades added at start and end [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **mmj2002-05-01.aud.flac16**: taped by George \"Low Dog\" S.; transferred by Magnix; source: AUD MD > CD-R [1]. Also: Transferred from CD-R via EAC to FLAC level 8; taped by Low Dog, per the uploader [1]",
